# Files under plugins/builtin that may contain a throw-away private key (no-live-tokens.sh).
# Only the PRIVATE KEY pattern is waived for them; every other pattern still applies. Each file
# must carry this exact line, or the guard fails:
#   # aurora-fixture-key: throw-away, generated for fixtures, never valid upstream
# One repo-relative path per line.
plugins/builtin/github/tests/hooks.yaml
